  "content": {
    "id": "p5-q5-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "5",
    "prompt": "Find the equation of the circles that match each of the following descriptions:",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p5-q5-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "A circle is tangent to the $x$-axis at $Q(1,0)$ and passes through the point $R(3,1)$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$(x-1)^2+\\left(y-\\frac52\\right)^2=\\left(\\frac52\\right)^2$.\n\nThe radius to the point of tangency is perpendicular to the $x$-axis, so the centre is $(1,\\frac52)$.",
          "worked": "The radius at $Q$ is perpendicular to the $x$-axis, so let the centre be $C(1,b)$. Then $r^2=b^2$. Since $R$ lies on the circle,\n$$\\begin{align*}(3-1)^2+(1-b)^2&=b^2\\\\4+1-2b+b^2&=b^2\\\\5-2b&=0\\\\b&=\\frac52.\\end{align*}$$\nThus the centre is $(1,\\frac52)$ and the radius is $\\frac52$:\n$$(x-1)^2+\\left(y-\\frac52\\right)^2=\\left(\\frac52\\right)^2.$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 70
      },
      {
        "id": "p5-q5-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "A circle is tangent to the $y$-axis at $Q(0,5)$ and passes through the point $R(4,-3)$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$(x-10)^2+(y-5)^2=10^2$.\n\nThe radius to the point of tangency is perpendicular to the $y$-axis, so the centre is $(10,5)$.",
          "worked": "The radius at $Q$ is perpendicular to the $y$-axis, so let the centre be $C(a,5)$. Then $r^2=a^2$. Since $R$ lies on the circle,\n$$\\begin{align*}(4-a)^2+(-3-5)^2&=a^2\\\\16-8a+a^2+64&=a^2\\\\80-8a&=0\\\\a&=10.\\end{align*}$$\nThus the centre is $(10,5)$ and the radius is $10$:\n$$(x-10)^2+(y-5)^2=10^2.$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 68
      }
    ]
  },
